		{"id":"web-open","type":"text","text":"### 🔮 Open\n\nFinal free hostnames TBD — owner picks `*.pages.dev` / `*.workers.dev` at deploy time. Custom domain question parked; no purchase allowed either way.","x":330,"y":340,"width":740,"height":150},
		{"id":"web-content","type":"text","text":"### 🎨 Content system\n\n`src/content/*.ts`: site · products · shades · testimonials · markets · nav · links. `lib/validation/inquiry.ts`.\n\n`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` (fallback katariasyntex.com), `cloudflare-env.d.ts` with `INQUIRY_DB`. SEO: sitemap + robots + not-found.","x":330,"y":120,"width":740,"height":200},
		{"id":"web-inquiry","type":"text","text":"### ✉️ Inquiry route (force-dynamic)\n\n`POST /api/inquiry`: zod validate → honeypot silent-drop → rate limit 5/IP/15min via D1 count → insert into **separate D1** `kataria-web-inquiry` (owner decision 2026-08-31 — isolated from app D1, same account). Responses: 422 fieldErrors · 429 · 500.\n\nDev without bindings: validation passes, warn + `{ok:true}` — **data dropped until D1 exists**.","x":330,"y":-140,"width":740,"height":240},
		{"id":"web-routes","type":"text","text":"### 🌐 apps/web — Next.js + OpenNext on Workers\n\n| Route | Content |\n|---|---|\n| `/` | Hero → TrustStrip → YarnIndex → Process → ShadeStrip → Markets → Testimonials → CTA |\n| `/products` (+slug) | Product index |\n| `/shade-card` | Shade explorer + three.js loom |\n| `/about` | Story · service pillars · buyer segments |\n| `/contact` | Inquiry form |\n| `/links` | Business card |\n\nInter + Space Grotesk + IBM Plex Mono, Lenis smooth scroll. Company facts from `packages/shared COMPANY_DETAILS` — never hardcoded.","x":330,"y":-480,"width":740,"height":320},
		{"id":"fld-challans-clientRef","type":"text","text":"**clientRef** · text? ★ offline idempotency","x":-3110,"y":-4810,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-challans-originDevice","type":"text","text":"**originDevice** · text?","x":-3110,"y":-4758,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-packing_entries-workspaceId","type":"text","text":"**workspaceId** · → workspaces","x":-3110,"y":-4442,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-challans-createdAt","type":"text","text":"**createdAt** · ts","x":-3110,"y":-4706,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-challans-updatedAt","type":"text","text":"**updatedAt** · ts","x":-3110,"y":-4654,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"ui-shell","type":"text","text":"### 🧭 App shell\n\nDesktop: fixed sidebar w-60 ↔ collapsed rail w-14 (Ctrl+B, persisted). Mobile: translucent header + bottom tab bar `Home | Challans | Job work | Packing | More` (badge = pending sync) + drawer.\n\n**Sections:** Operations (Dashboard · Challans sales|outward · Returns · Raw Material) · Stock (Raw · Dyed · Packing) · Reports (7) · Color Organiser (colors + recipes) · Masters (4 tabs) · Administration (Team · Devices · Settings). Packer mode: Packing only.","x":-580,"y":-480,"width":750,"height":250},
		{"id":"fx-p0","type":"text","text":"### ✅ P0 — fixed\n\n- Android: 4 Capacitor plugins missing → all three sync files fixed (+ `@capacitor/preferences`)\n- Electron white screen → renderer `dist/` + main/preload `dist-electron/` via Bun build\n- PWA never shipped → `VitePWA` + real icons + `virtual:pwa-register`\n- IDOR packing transfer → workspace-scoped + `transfer_packing` check\n- Dev bypass “Skip QR” removed completely (not gated — deleted)","x":-580,"y":720,"width":750,"height":240},
		{"id":"fx-audit","type":"text","text":"### 🔧 2026-08-31 audit pass — all gates green\n\nServer 22 fixes (logger redaction, 500 leak closed, invite CAS, `db.batch()` members, returns balance excludes self, masters 409 `in_use`, QR CAS, bounded purge…) · offline 15 (sync false-success, stale snapshot 3-pass, probeServer via `api()` seam, storage guards…) · UI 10 (dirty-guard settings, logout hang, confirm queue…).","x":-580,"y":980,"width":750,"height":190},
		{"id":"fx-defer","type":"text","text":"### ⏸️ Deferred — owner decisions\n\n- Document-pipeline god-module split + DTOs into shared *(with DB rewrite)*\n- Router-level unsaved-form blocking *(needs createBrowserRouter)*\n- Tabs underline vs pill · bottom-nav/sidebar mismatch\n- `GET /challans` unbounded · transaction-log ↔ stock/movements overlap\n- **SPEC says scrypt, code uses PBKDF2 — owner picks the truth**","x":-580,"y":1190,"width":750,"height":170},
		{"id":"dev-acct","type":"text","text":"### 🧪 Test account (merged from TEST-ACCOUNT.md)\n\nCreated 2026-08-28 via the real signup flow: `owner@katariasyntex.dedyn.io` / `KsTest#2026` — workspace *Kataria Syntex Test* (Primary Admin). OTP is real email via Pingram; codes stored SHA-256-only (brute-force the 6-digit preimage to recover).\n\n⚠️ **STALE** (audit 2026-08-31): that user no longer exists in the dev D1 — the DB was recreated. Current dev user: phone `+91 6351570979`, no password, OTP-only.","x":330,"y":720,"width":740,"height":260},
		{"id":"dev-servers","type":"text","text":"### 🖥️ Dev servers & local DB\n\n```bash\nbun run dev:server   # wrangler pages dev :8788 (workerd)\nbun run dev          # Vite :1420\n```\n\nLocal D1 = `.wrangler/state/v3/d1/…sqlite` — plain SQLite, readable for OTP hashes. `bun run db:migrate:local` applies migrations.\n\n`.env*` / `.dev.vars` are owner-only — never read, echo or commit.","x":330,"y":1000,"width":740,"height":210},
		{"id":"dev-otp","type":"text","text":"### ⚠️ OTP testing limits\n\n5 sends /identifier/hr · **12/day** — an identifier at the daily cap is locked out until the oldest row ages out. Plan test sends accordingly or reuse an existing session.","x":330,"y":1230,"width":740,"height":130},
		{"id":"auth-ident","type":"text","text":"### 🪪 Identifier\n\nOne input: phone **or** email, auto-detected. Phone → E.164, email → lowercased.\n`POST /auth/lookup` → `{ exists, hasPassword, hasInvite }` drives routing. Zod at boundary; dummy-hash on missing user (no timing leak).","x":-1990,"y":-400,"width":540,"height":150},
		{"id":"api-routes","type":"text","text":"### ⚙️ Hono API — `functions/api/[[route]].ts`\n\nSame-origin `/api/*`. CORS allow-list via `CORS_ORIGIN` + `capacitor://localhost`.\n\n| Route | Gate |\n|---|---|\n| `/auth/*` lookup · otp · verify · password · session · qr | — |\n| `/health` · `/health/db` | — |\n| `/members` | requireAuth + resolveMember |\n| `/company` | manage_settings (lazy-creates row) |\n| `/masters/*` | manage_masters · 409 `in_use` on delete |\n| `/recipes` (+ versions/restore) | manage_masters (write) · member (read one for challan link) |\n| `/challans` + `/:id/pdf` | create/edit/delete_challan · ?type&fy&q · 25/100 pages |\n| `/returns` | create_return · balance excludes edited return |\n| `/raw-material` | create_raw_material |\n| `/packing` + transfer | create_packing + transfer_packing |\n| `/stock` + `/movements` | view_stock |\n| `/reports/*` + `/dashboard` | view_reports |\n\nMiddleware: query-stripped logger, secure headers, errors as `{ error: snake_case }` → `ui/lib/errors.ts`.","x":-1350,"y":-480,"width":620,"height":400},
		{"id":"auth-route","type":"text","text":"### 🔀 Routing\n\n- **Exists** → OTP (Pingram SMS/email) or password if hash exists\n- **New** → name (+ workspace name if no invite) → password optional, **hidden for pre-added members** → OTP → in\n- **Pre-added member** → straight into the inviting workspace; members are OTP-only\n- No invite → creates own workspace (primary admin). Membership resolves by identifier match — no codes typed","x":-1990,"y":-235,"width":540,"height":165},
		{"id":"ui-pages","type":"text","text":"### 📑 Pages (React.lazy per route)\n\n`/auth` · `/login/scan/:code` · `/` dashboard or packing · `/challans` (+ `/:id/print`) · `/outward` · `/returns` · `/raw-material` · `/stock/raw|dyed` · `/packing` · `/colors` Color Organiser · `/reports/*` · `/masters` · `/members` · `/devices` · `/settings`\n\nEvery route permission-gated; auth guard renders login inline. NO spinners anywhere — skeleton shimmer only.","x":-580,"y":-210,"width":750,"height":230},
		{"id":"ui-dash","type":"text","text":"### 📊 Dashboard\n\nWelcome + company/FY header.\n**FlowCards:** Sent · Returned · In Stock Raw · In Stock Dyed · Sold (negative → destructive).\n**Period:** fy | 30d | all with Δ% vs previous period.\n**Stats:** challans issued · total packages · net weight kg · job-work sendings.\n**Charts:** dispatch bars by FY month/30d + customer donut (top 5 + Other).\nRecent 6 challans + quick links.","x":-580,"y":40,"width":750,"height":230},
		{"id":"api-perms","type":"text","text":"### 🔑 Permissions (17)\n\n`create/edit/delete` × challan · return · raw_material · packing (+ `transfer_packing`) · `manage_masters` · `view_stock` · `view_reports` · `manage_members` · `manage_settings`\n\n- `memberships.isPrimaryAdmin` bypasses all\n- `isPackerOnlyWorkspace()` → only `create_packing`, single-screen packing mode\n- Nav hides what the user cannot open (`useCanSee()`)","x":-1350,"y":200,"width":620,"height":230},
		{"id":"ui-reports","type":"text","text":"### 📈 Reports & stock UI\n\n**7 reports:** Job-Work Balance · Over-Receipts · Stock Summary · Sales Register · Job-Work Register · Transaction Log · Party Summary. From/to picker, column toggles persisted (`reports.hiddenCols`), skeleton/empty/error states.\n\n**StockPage:** raw | dyed grouped denier × color × lot, q filter, lot chips, color dots, negative alert.","x":-580,"y":290,"width":750,"height":240},
		{"id":"auth-limits","type":"text","text":"### 🛡️ Limits\n\nOTP: 5/identifier/hr · 12/day · 30s resend · 3 tries/code · TTL 5m · SHA-256-only storage. Sessions: `devices` + `sessions` via tokenHash; lastSeen throttled 5m; revoke per device.","x":-1990,"y":420,"width":540,"height":110},
		{"id":"api-pipeline","type":"text","text":"### 🔄 Document pipeline\n\n- FY counters allocated via CAS retry loop; lost race → 409 `challan_number_conflict`\n- `clientRef` = offline idempotency key (no double-create on lost response)\n- `validateMasters()` snapshots denier/color names for historical fidelity\n- Multi-write = one `db.batch()` (D1 has no interactive transactions)\n- Stock ledger: every document writes `stock_entries`; returns recompute balance per challan excluding the edited return","x":-1350,"y":-60,"width":620,"height":240},
		{"id":"build-p1","type":"text","text":"### Phase 1 — Core flow\n\n- [ ] Raw material purchase (SPEC §1)\n- [ ] Job-work outward challan (SPEC §2)\n- [ ] Job-work return *(spec pending)*\n- [ ] Packing *(pending)*\n- [ ] Sales challan *(pending)*","x":-1690,"y":720,"width":300,"height":330},
		{"id":"build-p2","type":"text","text":"### Phase 2 — Visibility\n\n- [ ] Stock view *(pending)*\n- [ ] Reports *(pending)*\n\nPhases 1–2 write `stock_entries` → they drive Stock + Reports.","x":-1370,"y":720,"width":300,"height":330},
		{"id":"build-p3","type":"text","text":"### Phase 3 — Access & platform\n\n- [ ] Members / roles *(pending)*\n- [ ] Settings *(pending)*\n- [ ] Android (Capacitor) / desktop (Electron) / PWA — all three shells *(code done, unchecked)*","x":-1050,"y":720,"width":300,"height":330},
		{"id":"build-p0","type":"text","text":"### Phase 0 — Foundation\n\n- [x] App skeleton (Vite + React, Hono, Drizzle)\n- [x] Full auth: QR any-camera approve, phone/email OTP or password, auto-join members, QR fallback on OTP quota *(verified 2026-08-25)*\n- [ ] Denier master\n- [ ] App shell navigation *(coded, unchecked)*","x":-2040,"y":720,"width":300,"height":330},
		{"id":"build-unspecced","type":"text","text":"### ⏳ Not yet specced\n\nJob-work return · Packing · Sales challan · Stock · Reports · Members/roles · Settings.\n\nSPEC · BUILD · CLOUDFLARE · FIXES are archived in `dead-files/` — owner's word wins. Write decisions down before coding. Ask one question at a time, build one thing at a time.","x":-2010,"y":1080,"width":640,"height":240},
		{"id":"build-tickrule","type":"text","text":"### ✅ Tick rule\n\n`- [ ]` → `- [x]` only when implemented **and** verified: typecheck + build green + works when run. Never redo a ticked item, never untick silently.\n\nNote: much of Phases 1–3 is already coded but stays unchecked until verified against SPEC.","x":-1350,"y":1080,"width":600,"height":240},
		{"id":"auth-qr","type":"text","text":"### 📷 QR login (primary path)\n\nDesktop shows QR → `/login/scan/<code>`; any camera approves.\n- Code `XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX` (~2⁷⁹), 10-min TTL, single-use CAS, approve requires session\n- `/qr/start` optional identifier → names exactly who logs in\n- Poll budget 600/IP\n- **OTP-quota fallback:** quota exhausted → screen flips to “show QR” → owner scans → member in, zero OTP","x":-1990,"y":0,"width":540,"height":210},
		{"id":"auth-pw","type":"text","text":"### 🔒 Password storage\n\nHashed server-side; client sends the password as-is (owner rejected client hashing).\nSPEC/CLOUDFLARE say **scrypt** (`node:crypto`, `nodejs_compat`); code today is **PBKDF2-SHA256** (Web Crypto): `pbkdf2$sha256$iter$salt$hash`, timing-safe, dummy hash for unknown users.\n⚠️ SPEC vs code mismatch — **owner to pick the truth**. Lockout: 10 fails / 15 min.","x":-1990,"y":230,"width":540,"height":170},
		{"id":"api-pdf","type":"text","text":"### 🖨️ PDFs\n\npdf-lib vector from shared `pdf-template.ts` — server and offline render byte-identical HQ. Header = company row. Filename sanitized. Capacitor filesystem+share+printer; Electron `kc:download` bridge.","x":-1350,"y":450,"width":620,"height":110},
