		{"id":"fld-challan_items-remarks","type":"text","text":"**remarks** · text","x":-2860,"y":-5090,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-challan_items-boxes","type":"text","text":"**boxes** · int","x":-2860,"y":-5038,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-workspaceId","type":"text","text":"**workspaceId** · → workspaces","x":-3610,"y":-5694,"width":200,"height":74},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-financialYearId","type":"text","text":"**financialYearId** · → financial_years","x":-3610,"y":-5642,"width":200,"height":54},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-entryNumber","type":"text","text":"**entryNumber** · text","x":-3610,"y":-5590,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-challan_items-netWt","type":"text","text":"**netWt** · real kg","x":-2860,"y":-4986,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-challan_items-createdAt","type":"text","text":"**createdAt** · ts","x":-2860,"y":-4934,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-supplierName","type":"text","text":"**supplierName** · text?","x":-3610,"y":-5486,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-createdAt","type":"text","text":"**createdAt** · ts","x":-3610,"y":-5226,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-updatedAt","type":"text","text":"**updatedAt** · ts","x":-3610,"y":-5174,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"biz-m2","type":"text","text":"**2 · Job-work outward challan** — grey out\ndate · job worker · denier · sacks · net kg · cones *(all req)*. No shade here — recorded on return\n→ `challans` (outward) + items · counter `outwardNext`","x":-4710,"y":-4647,"width":400,"height":115},
		{"id":"biz-m3","type":"text","text":"**3 · Job-work return** — dyed back\njob worker · invoiceNo (free, no counter) · items reference outward challans · overReceipt computed per challan\n→ `job_work_returns` + items","x":-4710,"y":-4520,"width":400,"height":115},
		{"id":"biz-m4","type":"text","text":"**4 · Packing** — bags/boxes\ntype `sale` (dyed) | `job_work` (raw) · entryNumber · sacks/cones · tare/gross → net\n→ `packing_entries` + items · counters `packingSale/JobNext`","x":-4710,"y":-4393,"width":400,"height":115},
		{"id":"biz-m5","type":"text","text":"**5 · Sales challan** — out the door\ncustomer · FY · auto challanNumber · items consume packing via `challan_item_sources` (exclusive)\n→ `challans` (sales) + items · counter `salesNext`","x":-4710,"y":-4266,"width":400,"height":115},
		{"id":"fld-raw_material_entries-id","type":"text","text":"**id** · PK","x":-3610,"y":-5746,"width":200,"height":44},
		{"id":"in-dec","type":"text","text":"### ☁️ Cloudflare decisions (owner, 2026-08-30)\n\n- **apps/app → Pages** (`*.pages.dev`) — static SPA + Pages Functions (Hono)\n- **apps/web → Workers** via OpenNext (Next stays force-dynamic)\n- **DB → D1** (Drizzle async, per-request `getDb(c.env.DB)`); fresh DB, masters re-entered by hand\n- Old hostnames die (`*.dedyn.io`); Google VM, Docker, Caddy, deSEC removed\n- **Passwords hashed server-side** — client sends plain; owner rejected client hashing\n- **PDFs: pdf-lib** shared template — byte-identical online/offline, no Browser quota\n- Backups = D1 Time Travel 7-day. PR previews via `wrangler-action@v4`\n- Pingram stays (per-message cost, owner-approved exception)","x":-2910,"y":-480,"width":770,"height":300},
		{"id":"in-status","type":"text","text":"### ✅ Migration status 2026-08-31 — done, verified\n\n- Server fully async D1; `db.batch()` for multi-write invariants\n- D1 rejects interactive `BEGIN` → standalone CAS updates + one `db.batch()` per flow; unique indexes backstop dupes\n- Local workerd verified: `/api/health`, `/api/health/db`, SPA, JSON `not_found`, all 3 migrations apply\n- apps/web: real `@opennextjs/cloudflare`, `wrangler types`, `INQUIRY_DB` binding; opennext-shim deleted\n- CI `cf-deploy.yml`: main deploys both projects + migrations; PR previews for the app\n- Client IP = `CF-Connecting-IP` (old XFF path behind `TRUST_PROXY=1`)","x":-2910,"y":-160,"width":770,"height":240},
		{"id":"in-tasks","type":"text","text":"### 🔑 Owner deploy tasks (never done by the agent)\n\n1. Cloudflare account (free)\n2. `wrangler d1 create kataria-app` + `kataria-web-inquiry` → paste ids into each `wrangler.jsonc`\n3. Pick final names; create Pages project + Worker; set `APP_URL` repo variable (native builds bake it)\n4. GitHub secrets: `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` + `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`\n5. `wrangler pages secret put` (PINGRAM_API_KEY …) + `.dev.vars` locally\n6. First deploy + smoke test on the free URLs\n\n**Still open:** final URLs (`kataria-app.pages.dev` / `kataria-site.workers.dev` proposed). Custom domain parked — no purchase allowed.","x":-2910,"y":100,"width":770,"height":250},
		{"id":"in-limits","type":"text","text":"### 📊 Free-tier limits (verified 2026-08-30)\n\n| Service | Limit |\n|---|---|\n| Workers / Pages Functions | 100k req/day · 10 ms CPU (rare overruns tolerated) |\n| D1 | 500 MB · 5M reads + 100k writes/day · Time Travel 7d |\n| `db.batch()` | single transaction — no interactive BEGIN |\n| Browser Rendering | unused (pdf-lib instead) |","x":-2910,"y":370,"width":770,"height":190},
		{"id":"ov-map","type":"text","text":"### 📦 Monorepo `kataria-syntex`\n\n| Path | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `apps/app` | Business app — challans, job work, stock, packing, reports |\n| `apps/web` | Public showcase website |\n| `packages/shared` | Domain types, yarn/shade data, validation |\n| `packages/tsconfig` | Shared TS presets |\n\nBun workspaces + Turborepo. One renderer bundle serves web, Electron and Capacitor.","x":-2920,"y":-1650,"width":770,"height":250},
		{"id":"ov-cmd","type":"text","text":"### 🔧 Commands (Bun only)\n\n```bash\nbun install\nbun run dev          # all dev servers\nbun run build        # gate\nbun run typecheck    # gate\nbun run lint         # gate\nbun run format:check\n\n# apps/app\nbun run dev:server   # wrangler pages dev (workerd) :8788\nbun run dev          # Vite :1420\nbun run electron:dev\n```\n\n**Done** = typecheck + lint + format + build green AND it works when run.","x":-2920,"y":-1380,"width":770,"height":330},
		{"id":"biz-m6","type":"text","text":"**6 · Color Organiser** — colors + recipes per denier\nOwns colors (Masters → Colors tab retired; picker inline-add stays). Recipe per **color + denier**: flat ingredient list (name · qty · unit g/mg/custom) · process temp °C · time hr/min/sec · notes. Every save = a version; last 5 kept, restore allowed. Open from challan detail items.\n→ `color_recipes` + ingredients + versions","x":-2640,"y":-2360,"width":400,"height":150},
		{"id":"ov-policy","type":"text","text":"### 💠 Infra policy (owner-mandated)\n\nFree forever ($0) · trusted durable providers only · zero lock-in (D1 = plain SQLite export, static bundles, env config) · minimal footprint (Cloudflare free tier) · minimal maintenance.\n\nHosting baseline: Pages + Workers + D1 + free Cloudflare hostnames. Anything on top needs owner approval.","x":-2920,"y":-1030,"width":770,"height":190},
		{"id":"biz-flow","type":"text","text":"### 🧶 Yarn lifecycle — every document writes `stock_entries`\n\n```\npurchase → job-work OUT (dyeing) → return → packing → sales challan\ngrey rolls    grey cones             dyed      packed    invoice\n```\n\nRolls cut to cones in-house: **not tracked**. No money anywhere — movement papers only.\nFY counters: `rawNext` · `outwardNext` · `salesNext` · `packingSaleNext` · `packingJobNext` (returns: free `invoiceNo`).","x":-5220,"y":-5494,"width":1250,"height":260},
		{"id":"biz-units","type":"text","text":"### 📐 Material identity & units\n\nA yarn = **denier** (+ shade once dyed). Masters `deniers` + `colors` (`stockType` raw|dyed) start empty; inline-add ＋ next to every dropdown.\n\n- kg + cones everywhere; sacks on job-work movement\n- Bags | Boxes + count on raw material & packing\n- `lotNo` optional (purchase only)\n- Stock grouped denier × color × lot\n- Gross − tare → net auto-calc, stays editable\n- No lot/batch tracking beyond optional lot no","x":-5220,"y":-4734,"width":460,"height":270},
		{"id":"biz-masters","type":"text","text":"### 🗂️ Masters (workspace-scoped)\n\nCustomers · job workers · suppliers · deniers — all inline-add pattern. Colors are owned by the Color Organiser (`/colors`); color pickers keep their inline-add.\n\n- `companies`: one per workspace, holds numbering JSON\n- Financial years created lazily on first document\n- Challan never changes type/FY via date edit\n- Delete blocked (409) while returns reference it\n- Old code lives in `dead-files/` — reference only, delete as features land","x":-5220,"y":-4444,"width":460,"height":250},
		{"id":"biz-m1","type":"text","text":"**1 · Raw material purchase** — stock in\ndate · denier · colour · net kg *(req)* · supplier + challan no · cones · packing Bags|Boxes · box no manual · gross−tare→net · lot no\n→ `raw_material_entries` + items · counter `rawNext`","x":-4710,"y":-4774,"width":400,"height":115},
